'''Keepers''' (also known as "Greed Heads") are bodiless {{E|Hanger}}s, commonly found in {{s|Catacombs}} and the {{s|Dank Depths}}. They can also be spawned by {{E|Super Greed}} and {{E|Ultra Greed}}, or found alongside Hangers. They move like {{E|Hopper}}s and occasionally stop to shoot two projectiles in a V shape towards Isaac. If hit by these projectiles, Isaac will drop or lose coins.

